(7542341, 1207678, 65234, '<td valign="top">That dog is a pudge! Nice, golden color and warm, comfortable feel to this.</td>', 'That dog is a pudge! Nice, golden color and warm, comfortable feel to this.', '2017-11-04 11:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542342, 1207642, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love Beardies! They are so photgenic, and this one is posing wonderfully well. Nice sharpness and detail, especially on the eye. Wouldn''t mind having his front feet included, but I know shooting animals can be a matter of split-second timing and you don''t always get exactly what you want.</td>', 'Love Beardies! They are so photgenic, and this one is posing wonderfully well. Nice sharpness and detail, especially on the eye. Wouldn''t mind having his front feet included, but I know shooting animals can be a matter of split-second timing and you don''t always get exactly what you want.', '2017-11-04 11:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542343, 1207469, 65234, '<td valign="top">Uncle Ernie has returned from the dead? Uncle Ernie really does look good in a dress? Uncle Ernie says it''s OK to wear white after Labor Day? OK, I''m going with interpretation one based on the wings. Fun image, and the wingtips make a nice frame for his head.</td>', 'Uncle Ernie has returned from the dead? Uncle Ernie really does look good in a dress? Uncle Ernie says it''s OK to wear white after Labor Day? OK, I''m going with interpretation one based on the wings. Fun image, and the wingtips make a nice frame for his head.', '2017-11-04 11:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542345, 1207671, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice macro; I know how hard it can be to just get one little bit of a flower in focus. Kind of want a slightly different angle so the stamens aren''t a partial background.</td>', 'Nice macro; I know how hard it can be to just get one little bit of a flower in focus. Kind of want a slightly different angle so the stamens aren''t a partial background.', '2017-11-04 11:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542346, 1207695, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute little fuzzy bumblebee.</td>', 'Cute little fuzzy bumblebee.', '2017-11-04 11:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542347, 1207694, 65234, '<td valign="top">That looks REALLY dangerous! Looks kinda'' like Great Falls, too, and I would never take any sort of watercraft into the maelstrom of the Potomac there. Very nice capture.</td>', 'That looks REALLY dangerous! Looks kinda'' like Great Falls, too, and I would never take any sort of watercraft into the maelstrom of the Potomac there. Very nice capture.', '2017-11-04 11:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542348, 1207662, 65234, '<td valign="top">Aww, a kitty. Who would probably hiss and spit if I got too close. Or run away. The junkyard is well represented in his surroundings.</td>', 'Aww, a kitty. Who would probably hiss and spit if I got too close. Or run away. The junkyard is well represented in his surroundings.', '2017-11-04 11:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542349, 1207711, 65234, '<td valign="top">You included the grid just to show this met the challenge perfectly, didn''t you LOL? Well done.</td>', 'You included the grid just to show this met the challenge perfectly, didn''t you LOL? Well done.', '2017-11-04 11:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542350, 1207387, 65234, '<td valign="top">Half that tree is missing. Hope the rest survives. Pretty scene. Might prefer this one in color, but I''m not sure.</td>', 'Half that tree is missing. Hope the rest survives. Pretty scene. Might prefer this one in color, but I''m not sure.', '2017-11-04 11:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542352, 1207487, 65234, '<td valign="top">That''s adorable! I''d include just a tad more empty space on the left, if I could. Put the little guy smack in the middle of the ROT intersection, especially for this challenge. Of course, you may not have had more grass over there, so my point may be moot. Still a nice image which meets the challenge.</td>', 'That''s adorable! I''d include just a tad more empty space on the left, if I could. Put the little guy smack in the middle of the ROT intersection, especially for this challenge. Of course, you may not have had more grass over there, so my point may be moot. Still a nice image which meets the challenge.', '2017-11-04 11:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542353, 1207288, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely pastel colors. Not sure I love the composition with the trees so centered on an ROT line. The empty space on the left is making me feel it''s unbalanced. I think I''m more an intersection kind of gal, anyway.</td>', 'Lovely pastel colors. Not sure I love the composition with the trees so centered on an ROT line. The empty space on the left is making me feel it''s unbalanced. I think I''m more an intersection kind of gal, anyway.', '2017-11-04 11:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542354, 1207707, 65234, '<td valign="top">Ooh, nice color in those trees. And the sky.</td>', 'Ooh, nice color in those trees. And the sky.', '2017-11-04 11:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542355, 1207698, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nicely detailed.</td>', 'Nicely detailed.', '2017-11-04 11:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542356, 1207670, 65234, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t scream ROT to me with the painter off to the side like that. If the painter was standing on a vertical ROT gridline I think I''d like it better for this challenge. But it''s a pretty scene.</td>', 'This doesn''t scream ROT to me with the painter off to the side like that. If the painter was standing on a vertical ROT gridline I think I''d like it better for this challenge. But it''s a pretty scene.', '2017-11-04 11:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542358, 1207685, 65234, '<td valign="top">Wow, you were PRECISE with this composition! The bird''s a nice asymmetrical add.</td>', 'Wow, you were PRECISE with this composition! The bird''s a nice asymmetrical add.', '2017-11-04 11:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542359, 1207704, 65234, '<td valign="top">The sun draws my eye with its brightness, but it''s not on a ROT grid. For this challenge, I expected a focal point on a line or intersection and there really isn''t one. Not that it''s not a nice image. The sky is particularly pretty.</td>', 'The sun draws my eye with its brightness, but it''s not on a ROT grid. For this challenge, I expected a focal point on a line or intersection and there really isn''t one. Not that it''s not a nice image. The sky is particularly pretty.', '2017-11-04 12:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542360, 1207643, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and bokeh. I like that you got a diagonal in but still have his little face smack on an ROT intersection. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice composition and bokeh. I like that you got a diagonal in but still have his little face smack on an ROT intersection. Well done.', '2017-11-04 12:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7542361, 1207571, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice to have the bird flying out of the frame like that.</td>', 'Interesting choice to have the bird flying out of the frame like that.', '2017-11-04 12:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
