(7543453, 1207571, 179769, '<td valign="top">I''d rather see the gull flying into the frame, rather than out of it, but nice.</td>', 'I''d rather see the gull flying into the frame, rather than out of it, but nice.', '2017-11-08 13:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543454, 1207694, 179769, '<td valign="top">Wow! What a capture!</td>', 'Wow! What a capture!', '2017-11-08 13:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543464, 1207429, 173844, '<td valign="top">The thirds here flow into position as this interesting-looking woman stops for a moment.  Composition, contrast, light, texture, concision, and sympathetic observation -  all harmoniously work together here.  I especially enjoy how her shadow seems to take flight.  A modest gem.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'The thirds here flow into position as this interesting-looking woman stops for a moment.  Composition, contrast, light, texture, concision, and sympathetic observation -  all harmoniously work together here.  I especially enjoy how her shadow seems to take flight.  A modest gem.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2017-11-08 15:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543465, 1207708, 173844, '<td valign="top">"Moment" indeed.  Her glance towards the photographer -  I figure that''s what''s going on  - makes the entire image reverberate.  She and her partner are now in curious, awkward juxtaposition.  For that moment.  The photographer has instigated the image, and it''s a fine one at that.  The surroundings feel right.  His white sleeve is a terrific line that leads to their hands.  Good placement of the bench at a vertex.  Very fine image.</td>', '"Moment" indeed.  Her glance towards the photographer -  I figure that''s what''s going on  - makes the entire image reverberate.  She and her partner are now in curious, awkward juxtaposition.  For that moment.  The photographer has instigated the image, and it''s a fine one at that.  The surroundings feel right.  His white sleeve is a terrific line that leads to their hands.  Good placement of the bench at a vertex.  Very fine image.', '2017-11-08 16:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543467, 1207680, 173844, '<td valign="top">So strong and studied that this could be a stage set. The woman, who appears to be absorbed in the moment, is planted on a thirds line.  The three glamorous women nicely situate the woman with her cart in humble contrast.  This wonderful image is well-framed by the less exalted workaday continuations on the left and right.  Let the opera commence!</td>', 'So strong and studied that this could be a stage set. The woman, who appears to be absorbed in the moment, is planted on a thirds line.  The three glamorous women nicely situate the woman with her cart in humble contrast.  This wonderful image is well-framed by the less exalted workaday continuations on the left and right.  Let the opera commence!', '2017-11-08 16:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543471, 1207699, 173844, '<td valign="top">Excellent image that conveys this number 7 train''s power and beauty -  and noise -  as it rumbles towards Manhattan, traveling through typical urban terrain.  I live in Queens and am familiar with this type of scene, and  appreciate how quintessential this portrayal is.  The copious detail can absorb ones attention for some time.  The rear door window is placed at a vertex, which invites you to peer inside.  The out of focus stuff in the foreground is unfortunate, but that''s how it goes in such a crowded environment.  Thank you for offering this image.</td>', 'Excellent image that conveys this number 7 train''s power and beauty -  and noise -  as it rumbles towards Manhattan, traveling through typical urban terrain.  I live in Queens and am familiar with this type of scene, and  appreciate how quintessential this portrayal is.  The copious detail can absorb ones attention for some time.  The rear door window is placed at a vertex, which invites you to peer inside.  The out of focus stuff in the foreground is unfortunate, but that''s how it goes in such a crowded environment.  Thank you for offering this image.', '2017-11-08 16:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543475, 1207643, 173844, '<td valign="top">This monkey (thought it''s a gibbon, but couldn''t find a color match on google images) is perfectly situated for this challenge.  He/she and his/her branch are really well-focused. The plaintive look, to be anthropocentric, draws out one''s sympathy.  The bokeh is wonderful.  Fine image.</td>', 'This monkey (thought it''s a gibbon, but couldn''t find a color match on google images) is perfectly situated for this challenge.  He/she and his/her branch are really well-focused. The plaintive look, to be anthropocentric, draws out one''s sympathy.  The bokeh is wonderful.  Fine image.', '2017-11-08 17:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543524, 1207429, 114285, '<td valign="top">That shadow!! Brilliant! My top pick</td>', 'That shadow!! Brilliant! My top pick', '2017-11-09 04:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543525, 1207611, 114285, '<td valign="top">Well spotted street life! My pick for red.</td>', 'Well spotted street life! My pick for red.', '2017-11-09 04:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
