(7543527, 1207681, 114285, '<td valign="top">Great minimalist image, top five for me.</td>', 'Great minimalist image, top five for me.', '2017-11-09 04:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543528, 1207680, 114285, '<td valign="top">She needs some customers! Brilliant light! Top five for sure.</td>', 'She needs some customers! Brilliant light! Top five for sure.', '2017-11-09 04:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543546, 1207689, 124815, '<td valign="top">what a fetching nightmare</td>', 'what a fetching nightmare', '2017-11-09 10:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543550, 1207260, 124815, '<td valign="top">Ha ha, what a chatterbox</td>', 'Ha ha, what a chatterbox', '2017-11-09 10:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543562, 1207678, 173844, '<td valign="top">An engaging and dynamic image.  The nostalgic toning seems to slow down the pace of life.  I like the pattern in the foreground of the sparkling on the water.  The greens of the foliage are varied and soft, reemphasizing the overall dreaminess.</td>', 'An engaging and dynamic image.  The nostalgic toning seems to slow down the pace of life.  I like the pattern in the foreground of the sparkling on the water.  The greens of the foliage are varied and soft, reemphasizing the overall dreaminess.', '2017-11-09 12:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543563, 1207644, 173844, '<td valign="top">Using the road, or alley, as a thirds line opens up the scene and extends it out of the frame.  The moving man, who is well-presented, hits his mark on a vertex.  It''s a pretty environment, so fitting for a artist.  The light is pleasing.  An enjoyable image.</td>', 'Using the road, or alley, as a thirds line opens up the scene and extends it out of the frame.  The moving man, who is well-presented, hits his mark on a vertex.  It''s a pretty environment, so fitting for a artist.  The light is pleasing.  An enjoyable image.', '2017-11-09 13:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543564, 1207709, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like the amount of motion captured in this seemingly casual image.  The biker at the right is minimally wispy, retaining the greater part of his form.  The trees and road are likewise nicely blurred.  Altogether unhurriedly dynamic.  Fine photo.</td>', 'I like the amount of motion captured in this seemingly casual image.  The biker at the right is minimally wispy, retaining the greater part of his form.  The trees and road are likewise nicely blurred.  Altogether unhurriedly dynamic.  Fine photo.', '2017-11-09 13:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543566, 1207708, 103142, '<td valign="top">It could be interesting, but it''s so severely underexposed, it''s hard to get past it. :(</td>', 'It could be interesting, but it''s so severely underexposed, it''s hard to get past it. :(', '2017-11-09 15:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543567, 1207671, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nicely done and nice colors. I''m wondering how you can catch the interest a little more. I think it''s lovely, but I''m ready to move on quickly. Can anything be done to make it more than just a "nice" photo? -6-</td>', 'Nicely done and nice colors. I''m wondering how you can catch the interest a little more. I think it''s lovely, but I''m ready to move on quickly. Can anything be done to make it more than just a "nice" photo? -6-', '2017-11-09 15:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543568, 1207650, 103142, '<td valign="top">Intriguing. I''ve of mixed minds on this one. -7- for my gut feel.</td>', 'Intriguing. I''ve of mixed minds on this one. -7- for my gut feel.', '2017-11-09 15:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543569, 1207313, 103142, '<td valign="top">I understand that they''re on the right 1/3 line, but I think this is a case where I''d actually like them even closer to the lower 1/3 as well. I''m not sure centering vertically is the best choice here. A little more head room might be nice since that background is more interesting than the foreground.</td>', 'I understand that they''re on the right 1/3 line, but I think this is a case where I''d actually like them even closer to the lower 1/3 as well. I''m not sure centering vertically is the best choice here. A little more head room might be nice since that background is more interesting than the foreground.', '2017-11-09 15:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543572, 1207469, 97225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! Great to see something so different. Top pick. 10</td>', 'Wonderful! Great to see something so different. Top pick. 10', '2017-11-09 15:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543573, 1207642, 97225, '<td valign="top">Wow! He''s got attitude. Top few.</td>', 'Wow! He''s got attitude. Top few.', '2017-11-09 15:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543574, 1207682, 97225, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.</td>', 'Very pretty.', '2017-11-09 15:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543576, 1207288, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful place, gorgeous colours.</td>', 'Beautiful place, gorgeous colours.', '2017-11-09 15:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543579, 1207698, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Top few.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Top few.', '2017-11-09 15:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543580, 1207455, 103142, '<td valign="top">A good idea, but I don''t know that the bottom of the photo is strong enough to place things on the top third. It points out the shallow depth of field and the fuzziness of the stem. If that were more interesting, it might be able to carry it off. As is, I think it leaves 2/3s of the photo at a lower quality than the flowers and it doesn''t work for me. sorry.</td>', 'A good idea, but I don''t know that the bottom of the photo is strong enough to place things on the top third. It points out the shallow depth of field and the fuzziness of the stem. If that were more interesting, it might be able to carry it off. As is, I think it leaves 2/3s of the photo at a lower quality than the flowers and it doesn''t work for me. sorry.', '2017-11-09 15:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543582, 1207611, 97225, '<td valign="top">Great juxtaposition. (And I just love that mural.) Top few.</td>', 'Great juxtaposition. (And I just love that mural.) Top few.', '2017-11-09 15:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543584, 1207642, 103142, '<td valign="top">I love the head and the face, but there are nitpicky things that are getting to me a bit. The foreleg being cut off and the tones in the body being such a different color cast. For how great the head is, I think the rest pulls it down. I wonder if you would have been better off cropping this portrait and having the eye at the upper 1/3 cross section?</td>', 'I love the head and the face, but there are nitpicky things that are getting to me a bit. The foreleg being cut off and the tones in the body being such a different color cast. For how great the head is, I think the rest pulls it down. I wonder if you would have been better off cropping this portrait and having the eye at the upper 1/3 cross section?', '2017-11-09 15:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543585, 1207620, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m really liking this, but the oversaturation is painful on the right. Especially how it gets the really bright orange outline. It actually works on the left, but not on the right. I wonder if it would have worked much better bringing down the saturation by using a gradient mask, so that not only does the figure and focus fade, but the colors soften as well.</td>', 'I''m really liking this, but the oversaturation is painful on the right. Especially how it gets the really bright orange outline. It actually works on the left, but not on the right. I wonder if it would have worked much better bringing down the saturation by using a gradient mask, so that not only does the figure and focus fade, but the colors soften as well.', '2017-11-09 15:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543586, 1207620, 173844, '<td valign="top">Colorful and exciting.  The excitement seems to arise from the shallow depth of field.  The focused post on the left sets up a desire to see what''s going on with the figure at the end of the walkway, but she''s almost swallowed in blur.  Maybe I could just as easily have said frustrating as exciting, but the latter response is what I felt.  This is a very well conceived and accomplished image, which becomes more appealing as I revisit it.</td>', 'Colorful and exciting.  The excitement seems to arise from the shallow depth of field.  The focused post on the left sets up a desire to see what''s going on with the figure at the end of the walkway, but she''s almost swallowed in blur.  Maybe I could just as easily have said frustrating as exciting, but the latter response is what I felt.  This is a very well conceived and accomplished image, which becomes more appealing as I revisit it.', '2017-11-09 15:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543587, 1207685, 103142, '<td valign="top">When I''m going through and commenting, I''m trying to figure out if there''s a purpose to the rule of thirds. Not all photos benefit by it. I think you took on too much by putting the rocks in the foreground. They don''t seem to fit into the photo. The pilings and sky are such wonderful cool tones, and the water is soft as silky. The rocks just end up jarring. You could still have had the rule of thirds with the pilings and bird, and I think it would have been a much stronger photo.</td>', 'When I''m going through and commenting, I''m trying to figure out if there''s a purpose to the rule of thirds. Not all photos benefit by it. I think you took on too much by putting the rocks in the foreground. They don''t seem to fit into the photo. The pilings and sky are such wonderful cool tones, and the water is soft as silky. The rocks just end up jarring. You could still have had the rule of thirds with the pilings and bird, and I think it would have been a much stronger photo.', '2017-11-09 15:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543588, 1207674, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the negative space -- it makes the rest more inviting. However, I''m not sure of the placement. I feel like it''s falling out of the frame on the right. I wonder if placing it at the bottom third and rotating it a bit would make the image stronger?</td>', 'I like the negative space -- it makes the rest more inviting. However, I''m not sure of the placement. I feel like it''s falling out of the frame on the right. I wonder if placing it at the bottom third and rotating it a bit would make the image stronger?', '2017-11-09 15:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543589, 1207440, 103142, '<td valign="top">You can''t go wrong with a heron! :)<br/> <br/>Something looks a little odd in his coloring. Did you lighten the eye? It seems to really glow where as that side of the face is really quite in shadow. I wonder if lightening and warming the head just a tad would yield a more pleasing result?</td>', 'You can''t go wrong with a heron! :) Something looks a little odd in his coloring. Did you lighten the eye? It seems to really glow where as that side of the face is really quite in shadow. I wonder if lightening and warming the head just a tad would yield a more pleasing result?', '2017-11-09 15:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543590, 1207429, 103142, '<td valign="top">Yes! Number 10 Downing Street! My times have changed, haven''t they?<br/> <br/>Masterfully done. Love every bit about it. -9-</td>', 'Yes! Number 10 Downing Street! My times have changed, haven''t they? Masterfully done. Love every bit about it. -9-', '2017-11-09 15:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543591, 1207487, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done, but I think the crop is actually a bit uncomfortable. This is one of the few times where I really would have liked to have the butterfly on the true 1/3 (vertically and horizontally), not just vertically. Otherwise nicely done. Looks like an American Lady?</td>', 'Very nicely done, but I think the crop is actually a bit uncomfortable. This is one of the few times where I really would have liked to have the butterfly on the true 1/3 (vertically and horizontally), not just vertically. Otherwise nicely done. Looks like an American Lady?', '2017-11-09 15:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543592, 1207709, 103142, '<td valign="top">Again -- another where I would actually like the subject to be on the 1/3 both vertically and horizontally. Too much foreground which isn''t as interesting as the background. I think moving the biker down would be more interesting.</td>', 'Again -- another where I would actually like the subject to be on the 1/3 both vertically and horizontally. Too much foreground which isn''t as interesting as the background. I think moving the biker down would be more interesting.', '2017-11-09 15:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543593, 1207686, 173844, '<td valign="top">A familiar landscape graced with a rather handsome blue tractor, working the field.  The foreground and background are handled so well that I don''t lose my enjoyment of revisiting.  Great dust.  Fine image.</td>', 'A familiar landscape graced with a rather handsome blue tractor, working the field.  The foreground and background are handled so well that I don''t lose my enjoyment of revisiting.  Great dust.  Fine image.', '2017-11-09 15:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543594, 1207707, 103142, '<td valign="top">That''s not an eagle. I''m studying to be a master naturalist and I know my birds. It looks like either a pterodactyl or a pteranodon. :) Fun catch.</td>', 'That''s not an eagle. I''m studying to be a master naturalist and I know my birds. It looks like either a pterodactyl or a pteranodon. :) Fun catch.', '2017-11-09 15:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543595, 1207640, 103142, '<td valign="top">Haha! <br/> <br/>It looks like you forced the 1/3, but I actually like the negative space in this.</td>', 'Haha!  It looks like you forced the 1/3, but I actually like the negative space in this.', '2017-11-09 15:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543597, 1207670, 103142, '<td valign="top">Intriguing. I wish there wasn''t so much dark space at the bottom, or that perhaps there was a little bit of detail in it. But the rest is really nice.</td>', 'Intriguing. I wish there wasn''t so much dark space at the bottom, or that perhaps there was a little bit of detail in it. But the rest is really nice.', '2017-11-09 15:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543598, 1207429, 115814, '<td valign="top">Great light and textures supporting the subject and location.</td>', 'Great light and textures supporting the subject and location.', '2017-11-09 15:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543599, 1207710, 97225, '<td valign="top">Be careful what you wish for, haha. But they are cute.</td>', 'Be careful what you wish for, haha. But they are cute.', '2017-11-09 15:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543600, 1207656, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like it quite a bit, but I wish it wasn''t cropped so high -- that there was a little more head space for our person. It feels a little claustrophobic. Other than that, nicely seen and captured.</td>', 'I like it quite a bit, but I wish it wasn''t cropped so high -- that there was a little more head space for our person. It feels a little claustrophobic. Other than that, nicely seen and captured.', '2017-11-09 15:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543601, 1207694, 97225, '<td valign="top">Wow! That''s extreme. Great capture.</td>', 'Wow! That''s extreme. Great capture.', '2017-11-09 15:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543602, 1207661, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautifully serene.</td>', 'Beautifully serene.', '2017-11-09 15:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543603, 1207611, 115814, '<td valign="top">I want to know more. I can''t stop looking.</td>', 'I want to know more. I can''t stop looking.', '2017-11-09 15:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543604, 1207681, 173844, '<td valign="top">Impressive landscape despite the seeming sameness of much of the terrain.  This has a lot to do with the quality of the light.  What I really enjoy is how the meandering river teases its way up the left vertical thirds line.  It''s confidently casual, content with approximation.  Fine image.</td>', 'Impressive landscape despite the seeming sameness of much of the terrain.  This has a lot to do with the quality of the light.  What I really enjoy is how the meandering river teases its way up the left vertical thirds line.  It''s confidently casual, content with approximation.  Fine image.', '2017-11-09 15:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543605, 1207280, 103142, '<td valign="top">Don''t know on this one. Technically, does it meet rule of thirds? Yes and no. But close enough. The idea is really intriguing. I guess I wish that the hand was a little more blurred or sharper. It''s uncomfortably blurry, which makes me just want to rub my eyes. So while I really really want to like it, because it''s quite cool, it doesn''t quite work.</td>', 'Don''t know on this one. Technically, does it meet rule of thirds? Yes and no. But close enough. The idea is really intriguing. I guess I wish that the hand was a little more blurred or sharper. It''s uncomfortably blurry, which makes me just want to rub my eyes. So while I really really want to like it, because it''s quite cool, it doesn''t quite work.', '2017-11-09 15:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543606, 1207640, 97225, '<td valign="top">Adorable.</td>', 'Adorable.', '2017-11-09 16:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543607, 1207662, 115814, '<td valign="top">Interesting tableau and engaging color palette with effective RoT subject placement. He/she doesn''t look as scrawny as I''d expect in the environment, though.</td>', 'Interesting tableau and engaging color palette with effective RoT subject placement. He/she doesn''t look as scrawny as I''d expect in the environment, though.', '2017-11-09 16:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543608, 1207138, 103142, '<td valign="top">Quite cool -- but the sky is just too overdone, IMO, plus it really brings out the sensor dust. Taking it down quite a bit would have given it even a greater sense of depth and emptiness. It hurts the photo, imo. Sorry</td>', 'Quite cool -- but the sky is just too overdone, IMO, plus it really brings out the sensor dust. Taking it down quite a bit would have given it even a greater sense of depth and emptiness. It hurts the photo, imo. Sorry', '2017-11-09 16:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543609, 1207296, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2017-11-09 16:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543610, 1207678, 68504, '<td valign="top">classic. lovely restraint. great depth, almost unexpected but strangely reassuring.</td>', 'classic. lovely restraint. great depth, almost unexpected but strangely reassuring.', '2017-11-09 16:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543611, 1207644, 115814, '<td valign="top">An effective combination of context, color, and motion. I really appreciate the restraint in saturation and vibrancy. And the RoT placement of the subject in motion all works to draw attention right to where you want it.</td>', 'An effective combination of context, color, and motion. I really appreciate the restraint in saturation and vibrancy. And the RoT placement of the subject in motion all works to draw attention right to where you want it.', '2017-11-09 16:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543612, 1207387, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nice. Small thing -- I wish there were more contrast, especially with your title. It''s really quite peaceful as it is now, and doesn''t speak harsh at all to me.</td>', 'Nice. Small thing -- I wish there were more contrast, especially with your title. It''s really quite peaceful as it is now, and doesn''t speak harsh at all to me.', '2017-11-09 16:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543613, 1207440, 115814, '<td valign="top">I like the way the subject placement leaves lots of room on the right and adds to the mystery of what''s got the bird''s rapt attention.</td>', 'I like the way the subject placement leaves lots of room on the right and adds to the mystery of what''s got the bird''s rapt attention.', '2017-11-09 16:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543614, 1207200, 103142, '<td valign="top">Ummm... So you''re trying to draw our eye to whats on the thirds?! :P</td>', 'Ummm... So you''re trying to draw our eye to whats on the thirds?! :P', '2017-11-09 16:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543615, 1207672, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nailed the thirds in a visually joyful way.  I like its straightforward manner.  When I look at this I feel like I''m on vacation.  Thanks.</td>', 'Nailed the thirds in a visually joyful way.  I like its straightforward manner.  When I look at this I feel like I''m on vacation.  Thanks.', '2017-11-09 16:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543616, 1207487, 68504, '<td valign="top">butterfly, close-up, and mushroom photos are difficult to sell, but you have done admirably. this is about pattern, texture and DOF.</td>', 'butterfly, close-up, and mushroom photos are difficult to sell, but you have done admirably. this is about pattern, texture and DOF.', '2017-11-09 16:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543617, 1207643, 115814, '<td valign="top">Nice RoT subject placement combined with a soft background that provides context without distracting from the subject, which has interesting posture and facial expression.</td>', 'Nice RoT subject placement combined with a soft background that provides context without distracting from the subject, which has interesting posture and facial expression.', '2017-11-09 16:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543618, 1207200, 68504, '<td valign="top">colour''s a treat.</td>', 'colour''s a treat.', '2017-11-09 16:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543619, 1207288, 103142, '<td valign="top">Ok -- feeling mixed about this one, too. Love the colors and the processing, but the centering of the trees just feels wrong. Plus the hills in the background and that splash of pinks is marvelous. I''m wondering if it would have been better keeping things on the bottom 1/3 horizaontally, but placing the tree grouping on the lower left third instead of centered. <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1207999" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1207999.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1207999.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1207999.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Ok -- feeling mixed about this one, too. Love the colors and the processing, but the centering of the trees just feels wrong. Plus the hills in the background and that splash of pinks is marvelous. I''m wondering if it would have been better keeping things on the bottom 1/3 horizaontally, but placing the tree grouping on the lower left third instead of centered.  ', '2017-11-09 16:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543621, 1207706, 12611, '<td valign="top">so much drama on top o'' the mountain!</td>', 'so much drama on top o'' the mountain!', '2017-11-09 16:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543622, 1207313, 68504, '<td valign="top">lovely amazonettes.</td>', 'lovely amazonettes.', '2017-11-09 16:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543623, 1207711, 12611, '<td valign="top">Clarity where it need be, blur where it needs to be too...</td>', 'Clarity where it need be, blur where it needs to be too...', '2017-11-09 16:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543625, 1207376, 68504, '<td valign="top">a great ponderment... (I think that provoking "..."''s in comments is a good indication that the book stays open).</td>', 'a great ponderment... (I think that provoking "..."''s in comments is a good indication that the book stays open).', '2017-11-09 16:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543626, 1207469, 173844, '<td valign="top">Delicious high key image.  Looks like he''s posing before a backdrop.  I''m really enjoying this while being contentedly baffled.  Maybe it''s an in joke.  Uncle Ernie, good for you.</td>', 'Delicious high key image.  Looks like he''s posing before a backdrop.  I''m really enjoying this while being contentedly baffled.  Maybe it''s an in joke.  Uncle Ernie, good for you.', '2017-11-09 16:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543628, 1207661, 173844, '<td valign="top">Subtle use of the rule of thirds, which is suitable for this quiet, serene image.  I understand why the upper portion is considerably vignetted, but feel a need for greater access to the sky.  That''s minor, I like this photo.</td>', 'Subtle use of the rule of thirds, which is suitable for this quiet, serene image.  I understand why the upper portion is considerably vignetted, but feel a need for greater access to the sky.  That''s minor, I like this photo.', '2017-11-09 16:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543630, 1207288, 173844, '<td valign="top">This lovely image certainly does promise a fine day ahead.  The trees and mudflats are balanced and immaculate.  The enormous sky is charming.  I like how the terrain beneath the foreground water is revealed.</td>', 'This lovely image certainly does promise a fine day ahead.  The trees and mudflats are balanced and immaculate.  The enormous sky is charming.  I like how the terrain beneath the foreground water is revealed.', '2017-11-09 16:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543631, 1207296, 173844, '<td valign="top">How observant to notice this delightful scene.  It''s like she''s dancing just for herself, or you since you''ve noticed, and now for all of us.  The brilliant yellows highlight the joyous mood.  The rule of thirds composition works very well here.  Fine, uplifting image.</td>', 'How observant to notice this delightful scene.  It''s like she''s dancing just for herself, or you since you''ve noticed, and now for all of us.  The brilliant yellows highlight the joyous mood.  The rule of thirds composition works very well here.  Fine, uplifting image.', '2017-11-09 16:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543632, 1207440, 173844, '<td valign="top">The heron is perfectly placed, detailed and intense.  The background is nicely blurred.  Straightforward and compelling.</td>', 'The heron is perfectly placed, detailed and intense.  The background is nicely blurred.  Straightforward and compelling.', '2017-11-09 16:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543633, 1207689, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very interesting, good photo.  That I don''t know what to make of it, not that anything needs to be made of it, seems neither here nor there.</td>', 'Very interesting, good photo.  That I don''t know what to make of it, not that anything needs to be made of it, seems neither here nor there.', '2017-11-09 16:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543635, 1207296, 115814, '<td valign="top">I like the fall color palette'' contrast with the dark branches of the tree trunk. It''s placement and even its presence elevates this from  verging  on abstraction to a meaningful fall image. Cool.</td>', 'I like the fall color palette'' contrast with the dark branches of the tree trunk. It''s placement and even its presence elevates this from  verging  on abstraction to a meaningful fall image. Cool.', '2017-11-09 16:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543636, 1207700, 173844, '<td valign="top">Great spider photo for this challenge.  The web extends throughout the frame, almost in defiance of further adherence to rules.  A fine image in its own right, it especially resonates in the Halloween season.</td>', 'Great spider photo for this challenge.  The web extends throughout the frame, almost in defiance of further adherence to rules.  A fine image in its own right, it especially resonates in the Halloween season.', '2017-11-09 16:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543637, 1207680, 115814, '<td valign="top">Well-placed subject for RoT, along with fascinating background art. It''s pretty busy, but the placement and lighting creates decent subject isolation. The left and bottom vignetting is too much for my taste... Still an effective response to the challenge.</td>', 'Well-placed subject for RoT, along with fascinating background art. It''s pretty busy, but the placement and lighting creates decent subject isolation. The left and bottom vignetting is too much for my taste... Still an effective response to the challenge.', '2017-11-09 16:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543638, 1207711, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice distillation of the challenge.  The range of grays is very pleasing.  I also like your choice of depth of field.</td>', 'Nice distillation of the challenge.  The range of grays is very pleasing.  I also like your choice of depth of field.', '2017-11-09 16:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543639, 1207695, 173844, '<td valign="top">Simple and very elegant.  The background blur is so well modulated.  Well done.</td>', 'Simple and very elegant.  The background blur is so well modulated.  Well done.', '2017-11-09 16:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543641, 1207429, 12611, '<td valign="top">Wow. Excellent. top three- I could stare at that shadow all day!</td>', 'Wow. Excellent. top three- I could stare at that shadow all day!', '2017-11-09 17:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543642, 1207662, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  Beautiful cat, coiled and wary.  Interesting background.  My only sticking point is that I''m not seeing the rule of thirds being utilized here to a recognizable extent.  But I very much like the image.</td>', 'Very nice photo.  Beautiful cat, coiled and wary.  Interesting background.  My only sticking point is that I''m not seeing the rule of thirds being utilized here to a recognizable extent.  But I very much like the image.', '2017-11-09 17:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543643, 1207288, 12611, '<td valign="top">perfectly flat and laid out before us. very well done.</td>', 'perfectly flat and laid out before us. very well done.', '2017-11-09 17:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543644, 1207440, 12611, '<td valign="top">helluva nature shot, great light</td>', 'helluva nature shot, great light', '2017-11-09 17:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
