(7543646, 1207656, 173844, '<td valign="top">Really captures the mood of the title.  Very interesting perspective, with the great majority of the action playing out in a rather narrow strip above the broad dark band.  The pose of the woman on the stool is evocative and transitional, as if she''s thinking, "I''m outta here."  Very fine black and white.</td>', 'Really captures the mood of the title.  Very interesting perspective, with the great majority of the action playing out in a rather narrow strip above the broad dark band.  The pose of the woman on the stool is evocative and transitional, as if she''s thinking, "I''m outta here."  Very fine black and white.', '2017-11-09 17:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543651, 1207644, 61396, '<td valign="top">what''s not to like in a good blur</td>', 'what''s not to like in a good blur', '2017-11-09 17:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7543652, 1207469, 61396, '<td valign="top">good job</td>', 'good job', '2017-11-09 17:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
