(7543670, 1207571, 115814, '<td valign="top">Well-handled tonal range and shutter speed to freeze motion. While the bird is certainly placed at the upper-right RoT intersection, I''d be curious to see the difference if the placement was based specifically on the bird''s eye.</td>', 'Well-handled tonal range and shutter speed to freeze motion. While the bird is certainly placed at the upper-right RoT intersection, I''d be curious to see the difference if the placement was based specifically on the bird''s eye.', '2017-11-09 17:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
