(7543861, 1207429, 124815, '<td valign="top">If this image was in a book of a vested, well known, celebrated photographer we would ask for a challenge to emulate his work. We had actually had one in the style of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=113156" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">jagar</a>, admitting that he was pretty good. At least for us.<br/> <br/>A few years after, we mark him with 4s an 5s and 6s. No 1 and 2 means a certain progress though.<br/>It is not a form breaking oeuvre, nothing blurry or unrecognizable, no use of neologisms or any pretension. Just a fabulous street shot. Then? A 7.23 average only?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2017-11-10 14:17:47.</i></td>', 'If this image was in a book of a vested, well known, celebrated photographer we would ask for a challenge to emulate his work. We had actually had one in the style of  jagar, admitting that he was pretty good. At least for us. A few years after, we mark him with 4s an 5s and 6s. No 1 and 2 means a certain progress though.It is not a form breaking oeuvre, nothing blurry or unrecognizable, no use of neologisms or any pretension. Just a fabulous street shot. Then? A 7.23 average only?', '2017-11-10 09:26:29.000000', '2017-11-10 14:17:47.000000', 0),
